## 🚀 RUN IT NOW (3 MINUTES)

### Option 1: Local Development
```bash
# Terminal 1 - Backend
cd backend
npm install
npm start

# Terminal 2 - Frontend  
cd frontend
npm install
node ../server.js

# Visit http://localhost:3000
```

### Option 2: Docker (Recommended)
```bash
docker-compose up -d
# Visit http://localhost
```

### Option 3: Cloud Deploy
```bash
# Heroku
heroku create meengle-app
git push heroku main

# AWS
eb create meengle-prod

# DigitalOcean
# Connect GitHub repo to App Platform
```

